# DB 서버 PC 가 재부팅되면 Tailscale 주소가 생긴 뒤 MySQL 컨테이너를 켠다 (선택).
# 설치 : User·경로·BIND_IP 를 고친 뒤
#   sudo cp deploy/db-server/library-mysql.service /etc/systemd/system/
#   sudo systemctl daemon-reload && sudo systemctl enable --now library-mysql
[Unit]
Description=library_db MySQL container (Docker)
Requires=docker.service
After=docker.service tailscaled.service network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=oneshot
RemainAfterExit=yes
User=delboy
Environment=BIND_IP=100.77.2.39
ExecStart=/home/delboy/library-system/deploy/db-server/start.sh
# 앞의 - : 컨테이너가 이미 없어도 실패로 보지 않는다
ExecStop=-/usr/bin/docker stop library-mysql
TimeoutStartSec=300

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
